                                            "type": "paragraph",
                                            "attrs": {
                                              "textAlign": null
                                            },
                                            "content": [
                                              {
                                                "type": "text",
                                                "text": "8:30 a.m. Graduates check-in"
                                              }
                                            ]
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      },
                                      {
                                        "type": "list_item",
                                        "content": [
                                          {
                                            "type": "paragraph",
                                            "attrs": {
                                              "textAlign": null
                                            },
                                            "content": [
                                              {
                                                "type": "text",
                                                "text": "8:55 a.m. Procession begins"
                                              }
                                            ]
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      },
                                      {
                                        "type": "list_item",
                                        "content": [
                                          {
                                            "type": "paragraph",
                                            "attrs": {
                                              "textAlign": null
                                            },
                                            "content": [
                                              {
                                                "type": "text",
                                                "text": "9:00 a.m. Ceremony begins"
                                              }
                                            ]
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "type": "paragraph",
                                    "attrs": {
                                      "textAlign": null
                                    },
                                    "content": [
                                      {
                                        "type": "text",
                                        "text": " Students will meet at 8:30 am near the Daines Concert Hall for this ceremony. Students will line up for the procession at 8:50 in the atrium down the stairs east of the Daines Concert Hall. Staff will be outside of Daines, directing students and families. At the Convocation, you will walk across the stage, hear your name read, receive your diploma cover, and have a professional photo taken. Graduation photos, programs, and video will be available a short time after the ceremony. Family and friends are encouraged to attend."
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              },
